- Occupation before latest pregnancy is in [Service, Business, Doctor, Teacher]  
- Age of newborn is in [Older than 1.5 year, 6 months to 1 year]  
- Pregnancy plan is Yes  
- Residence is City  
- Monthly income before latest pregnancy is in [10000 to 20000, 20000 to 30000, More than 30000]  
- Mode of delivery is Caesarean Section when Fear of pregnancy is No  
